# Directory spec for the `common` crate. Coarse boundary only; each domain module
# (jukebox, package model, engines) is specified by its own same-basename spec.

Spec: common

Platform: Rust

Purpose:
  Shared library crate carrying every Vynil-specific type used by the agent, operator, and
  server. It wraps the external `vynil-core` toolbox into the Vynil layer: the four CRD
  models, the package model, the context-aware Handlebars helpers, the Vynil Rhai bindings,
  the order-preserving YAML helpers, and the status-condition macros.

Structure:
  ./src/lib.rs: Crate root — `@Error`, `@Result`, `@RhaiRes`, shared constants
  ./src/context.rs: `@VynilContext` reconcile context and async client helpers
  ./src/jukebox.rs: `@JukeBox` model, source variants, package cache
  ./src/jukebox_file.rs: file-scan JukeBox variant (no cluster connection)
  ./src/vynilpackage.rs: `@VynilPackage` model, requirements, waypoint selection
  ./src/instanceservice.rs: `@ServiceInstance` model and Rhai bridge
  ./src/instancesystem.rs: `@SystemInstance` model
  ./src/instancetenant.rs: `@TenantInstance` model
  ./src/instance_macros.rs: `impl_condition_common!` status-condition codegen
  ./src/handlebarshandler.rs: Vynil Handlebars layer and context-aware helpers
  ./src/rhaihandler.rs: Vynil Rhai constructors and bindings
  ./src/yamlhandler.rs: order-preserving `@YamlDoc` helpers
  ./src/tools.rs: base64/gzip and misc helpers
  ./src/ttl_cache.rs: `@TtlCache` async TTL cache
  ./src/k8smock.rs: test-support Kubernetes/OCI mock re-exports

Owns:
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./Cargo.toml

Must:
  Expose only types and helpers genuinely shared across two or more consuming crates.
  Keep the serde-YAML path order-preserving only through `./src/yamlhandler.rs`; elsewhere rely
    on `vynil-core` alphabetical serde.
  Re-export the generic `vynil-core` engines behind Vynil newtypes so consumers do not select
    the engine layer themselves.

Must not:
  Depend on `agent`, `operator`, or `server`.
  Duplicate generic engine helpers already provided by `vynil-core`.

Depends on:
  `vynil-core`
  `kube`, `k8s-openapi`, `handlebars`, `rhai`, `serde_yaml`, `rust-yaml`

Done when:
  Each domain module above has a reviewed same-basename spec and `cargo test -p common` is green.

Tasks:
  [ ] #0 Spec `./src/vynilpackage.rs` (package model, requirements, waypoint selection).
  [ ] #1 Spec the four instance-model modules and `./src/instance_macros.rs`.
  [ ] #2 Spec `./src/jukebox.rs` and `./src/jukebox_file.rs`.
  [ ] #3 Spec the Handlebars, Rhai, and YAML handler modules.
